# An invented manual-style transcription, in the grammar
# tools/extract_catalog.py reads:
#
#     BANK NUMBER Name
#
# with optional leading whitespace, a bank id of letters and digits, a
# 1-3 digit number, whitespace, and the name to the end of the line.
# A line starting with '#' and a blank line are skipped without comment;
# anything else that does not parse is counted and skipped, never fatal.
#
# None of these names is Alesis's. They come from the demo's word pool,
# chosen to be obviously invented, so no screenshot or fixture of this
# project can be mistaken for the real program list.

GM 0 Tin Bell
GM 1 Glass Drone
USER 0 Paper Pluck
USER 1 Rubber Wash
P1 10 Copper Stab
P1 127 Velvet Sweep
P2 0 Chalk Hum
P2 5 Iron Bow
p3 64 Wool Choir
P3 127 Amber Reed

